# Small Group Pairing

Module containing all the code necessary for the small group pairing. First off, we'll need to install all the packages necessary using

```
yarn install
```

This module is built using TypeScript, so to build it we need to run

```
yarn run build
```

All tests should be added to the tests directory and run with

```
yarn run test
```

## Structure

At the top level, we have the Editor class (TODO) which will call the Loader class/implementation to get the list of campers and groups.

We pass those to the Pairings class which will create all the mappings between campers and groups. When we want to run the pairing algorithm, we call
any function that implements the PairingAlgorithm interface with the Pairings class which should return a deep copy with new Pairings.
